index 0000000..b60e5ae
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-retry-compose-plain-callable-6675670b863b0351.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Composing a retry strategy with a plain callable using ``|`` or ``&``
+    no longer raises ``AttributeError``. For example,
+    ``retry_if_exception_type(IOError) | my_predicate`` again produces a
+    ``retry_any`` (and ``&`` a ``retry_all``), in either operand order,
+    for both sync and async retry strategies. The type annotations accept
+    plain callables too.
